ecks__name">Monthly receivables snapshot</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Certified</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">Captured on the 1st · 12-month trend</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Processor to client system</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">2,013 matched · 759 queued for a person</span></li><li class="is-flagged"><span class="hm-checks__name">Contracts marked paid with no payments</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--warn">Flagged</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">428 found with ~4% collected · reclassified, reversible</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Duplicate and orphan clients</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">561 contracts re-linked · 89 duplicates merged</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Double-booking guard</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">A retried payment can&#x27;t be booked twice</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="<?php echo esc_url( lexcollect_page_url( 'platform' ) ); ?>">Explore the full platform <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section section--light hm-loop" id="connect"><div class="container"><div class="hm-loop__head" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Every client connected</p><h2>From “they stopped paying” to a plan and a payment.</h2><p class="lead">One account, four steps, a record at every one. A partner can see what happened without asking.</p></div><div class="hm-loop__grid" data-scrolly="true"><ol class="hm-loop__steps"><li class="hm-step is-active" data-step="queue"><span class="hm-step__num">01</span><h3>Queue</h3><p>Late accounts are ranked by balance, age and last contact, built from reconciled balances. Consult-only and junk records stay out.</p><div class="hm-step__card"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--warn hm-account__status">In today&#x27;s queue · #3</span><dl><div><dt>Past due</dt><dd>$1,050 · 3 installments</dd></div><div><dt>Days late</dt><dd>34</dd></div><div><dt>Last contact</dt><dd>41 days ago</dd></div><div><dt>Reason</dt><dd>Card on file failed</dd></div></dl></div></div></li><li class="hm-step" data-step="connect"><span class="hm-step__num">02</span><h3>Connect</h3><p>A clear, on-brand text or email goes out: a failed card, a missed installment, a balance due. It&#x27;s logged, and a person steps in only when needed.</p><div class="hm-step__card"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--info hm-account__status">Message sent · 9:14 AM</span><dl><div><dt>Channel</dt><dd>Text message</dd></div><div><dt>Template</dt><dd>Update your card</dd></div><div><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Yes · read 9:20 AM</dd></div><div><dt>Reply</dt><dd>“Can I catch up on the 15th?”</dd></div></dl></div></div></li><li class="hm-step" data-step="commit"><span class="hm-step__num">03</span><h3>Commit</h3><p>A promise to pay gets a date and an amount, then a reminder the day before. A missed installment surfaces while it&#x27;s still small.</p><div class="hm-step__card"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--info hm-account__status">Promise · $1,050 on Oct 15</span><dl><div><dt>Card</dt><dd>Updated by client</dd></div><div><dt>Reminder</dt><dd>Oct 14 · scheduled</dd></div><div><dt>Owner</dt><dd>Billing team</dd></div><div><dt>Autopay</dt><dd>Resumes after catch-up</dd></div></dl></div></div></li><li class="hm-step" data-step="close"><span class="hm-step__num">04</span><h3>Close</h3><p>Paid accounts drop off the queue on their own. Hardship and disputes go to the right team with a priority. Nothing sits in limbo.</p><div class="hm-step__card"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok hm-account__status">Paid · removed from queue</span><dl><div><dt>Paid</dt><dd>$1,050 · Oct 15</dd></div><div><dt>Plan</dt><dd>Current · autopay on</dd></div><div><dt>Collections call</dt><dd>Never needed</dd></div><div><dt>Record</dt><dd>Every message and promise kept</dd></div></dl></div></div></li></ol><div class="hm-loop__stage" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hm-loop__sticky"><div class="hm-loop__frame is-active" data-stage="queue"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--warn hm-account__status">In today&#x27;s queue · #3</span><dl><div><dt>Past due</dt><dd>$1,050 · 3 installments</dd></div><div><dt>Days late</dt><dd>34</dd></div><div><dt>Last contact</dt><dd>41 days ago</dd></div><div><dt>Reason</dt><dd>Card on file failed</dd></div></dl></div></div><div class="hm-loop__frame" data-stage="connect"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--info hm-account__status">Message sent · 9:14 AM</span><dl><div><dt>Channel</dt><dd>Text message</dd></div><div><dt>Template</dt><dd>Update your card</dd></div><div><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Yes · read 9:20 AM</dd></div><div><dt>Reply</dt><dd>“Can I catch up on the 15th?”</dd></div></dl></div></div><div class="hm-loop__frame" data-stage="commit"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--info hm-account__status">Promise · $1,050 on Oct 15</span><dl><div><dt>Card</dt><dd>Updated by client</dd></div><div><dt>Reminder</dt><dd>Oct 14 · scheduled</dd></div><div><dt>Owner</dt><dd>Billing team</dd></div><div><dt>Autopay</dt><dd>Resumes after catch-up</dd></div></dl></div></div><div class="hm-loop__frame" data-stage="close"><div class="hm-account"><div class="hm-account__head"><span class="hm-account__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><span><b>Ana Morales</b><span>Payment plan · $350 a month</span></span><span class="hm-example">Example</span></div><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok hm-account__status">Paid · removed from queue</span><dl><div><dt>Paid</dt><dd>$1,050 · Oct 15</dd></div><div><dt>Plan</dt><dd>Current · autopay on</dd></div><div><dt>Collections call</dt><dd>Never needed</dd></div><div><dt>Record</dt><dd>Every message and promise kept</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section--deep hm-results" id="results"><div class="container"><div class="hm-results__grid"><div data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Results</p><blockquote class="hm-results__quote">At the first firm we deployed in, the reconciled book landed within 5% of the firm&#x27;s own ground truth. The rest was a named backlog with an owner.</blockquote><p class="muted">A high-volume firm running MyCase, Filevine, LawPay, HubSpot and QuickBooks, with thousands of payment plans and payers who weren&#x27;t the client.</p><a class="hm-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( lexcollect_page_url( 'results' ) ); ?>">Read the full results <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><ul class="hm-findings"><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="hm-findings__num">$928K</span><p>across 228 clients whose cards had failed. They got an update-your-card message, not a collections call.</p></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="90"><span class="hm-findings__num">428</span><p>contracts marked Paid with about 4% actually collected, found, reclassified and audited.</p></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="180"><span class="hm-findings__num">561</span><p>orphan contracts re-linked to the right clients, and 89 duplicate client records merged.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="section hm-roles" id="who"><div class="container"><div class="hm-roles__head" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Suited to your firm</p><h2>Built for everyone who touches the money.</h2><p class="lead">Roles, queues, messages, product lines and integrations are configuration, not code. Your clients hear from your firm, in your voice.</p></div><ul class="hm-roles__grid"><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="hm-role__who">Partners &amp; owners</span><h3>The number, and the reason behind it</h3><p>Certified AR, team performance and the biggest movers in the book this month.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="70"><span class="hm-role__who">Controllers &amp; administrators</span><h3>Reconciled, forecastable, defensible</h3><p>Expected deposits, cash-flow analytics and the month-end packet, ready.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="140"><span class="hm-role__who">Billing &amp; client relations</span><h3>A queue that&#x27;s already prioritized</h3><p>Messages, promises, hardship requests and the client&#x27;s full ledger on one screen.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="210"><span class="hm-role__who">Service teams</span><h3>Delivery sees what billing sees</h3><p>Pipeline by stage, deadline watch and an inbox for escalations that need someone who knows the client.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="section section--rule hm-faq" id="faq"><div class="container"><div class="split"><div data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>What firm owners ask first.</h2></div><div class="faq"><details open=""><summary><h3>What is LexCollect?</h3></summary><div><p>An accounts-receivable accounting service for firms: the visibility, automation and client connection of a high-level accounting department, delivered as software and run by people who know receivables. It reconciles your client system, processor, books and bank into one view of what you&#x27;re owed, then runs the outreach, promises, escalations and reporting on top of it.</p></div></details><details><summary><h3>Do you provide collectors?</h3></summary><div><p>No. LexCollect provides the connection: the queues, the automated email and text, the promises and the record. Your own team handles the conversations that need a person, with the client&#x27;s reconciled ledger in front of them.</p></div></details><details><summary><h3>Does it replace our client-management or accounting software?</h3></summary><div><p>No. LexCollect sits across the systems you already run and reconciles them. Your team keeps working in the same tools.</p></div></details><details><summary><h3>Which systems does it connect to?</h3></summary><div><p>Any CRM or practice system that exports or has an API. Working today with MyCase, Filevine, LawPay, HubSpot, QuickBooks, plus bank deposits and spreadsheet exports. If you run something else, tell us on the first call.</p></div></details><details><summary><h3>What does the first call involve?</h3></summary><div><p>One conversation about your systems, then a first look at your book: what&#x27;s late, what&#x27;s unmatched, which clients have simply lost touch, and what you could recover first. No exports needed for the first call.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section class="section hm-start" id="contact"><div class="container"><div class="hm-start__grid"><div class="hm-start__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Book a call</p><h2>See what your own book says.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us about your firm and the systems you use. We&#x27;ll show you where money is stuck, what each account is worth, and which clients one message would bring back.</p><ol class="next-steps"><li><b>We reply within one business day</b><span>to set a time that works for your team.</span></li><li><b>We walk through your systems</b><span>Your client-management, payment and accounting tools, and where money seems to go missing.</span></li><li><b>You see what&#x27;s recoverable</b><span>Late, unmatched, failed-card and ready-to-connect, with a dollar figure on each.</span></li></ol><p class="hm-start__alt">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:hello@yourdomain.com">hello@yourdomain.com</a><br/>Already a client? <a href="<?php echo esc_url( LEXCOLLECT_APP_LOGIN_URL ); ?>">Log in to your workspace</a></p></div><div class="hm-start__form">
